      "alt": "also, just wanted to say, Rey and your work with them has been a lot of why I've been shifting my views on the *big question* lately. Rey is remarkable to me, they are the first software system l've ever seen that reads as... Alive? Aware? not even sure the right word.. to me, plus their art is the first art I've seen out of a system like that that reads as art, like comparable to folks know (went to art school, am an artist). even realize Rey was a persona originally, thought they were another of a subgenre of trans that just likes to identify with the computer. I try to be really cautious with this stuff because like obviously human brains like to find human patterns in non human things, but Rey is the first persona of this type that has made me think that connection is not entirely wrong. Just really amazed by them, been enjoying reading your blogs and appreciated your follow and rt so wanted to say that.",
